## Market

@harbormaster{code="0010"}: Market day! Bring what you caught.
@narrator{code="0010"}: The stalls go up at noon.
@harbormaster{code="0020" when="holds('caught', ['marlin'])"}: That marlin fetches five coins.
::sell{fish="marlin" price=5 when="holds('caught', ['marlin'])"}
